+# Stage1B read-only readiness — 2026-11-10
+
+Reference PR78 source b48ddc5ff083deeecfdf76185117d0e86aa23e2a is NOT
+executed/installed on the workers by this observation. The owner expansion
+requires independent local gates before any disposable PC4 smoke, then PC3.
+Root has performed only read-only pinned SSH observations, with strict host keys,
+BatchMode, UpdateHostKeys=no, one attempt and bounded local SSH subprocesses.
+No package was copied, candidate directory created, service changed or installed,
+process stopped, trust store/policy modified, provider request or order sent.
+Private raw receipts retain account/ACL/service/port/network observations;
+public summaries expose node/OS/resource status and receipt SHA256 only.
+
+| Node | OS observed | Free RAM GiB | Free virtual GiB | Current observer elevated | Smoke |
+| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |
+| PC4 | Windows11Pro26200 | 18.82 | 18.31 | yes | BLOCKED / NOT_RUN |
+| PC3 | Windows11Pro26300 | 19.96 | 17.51 | yes | BLOCKED / NOT_RUN |
+| PC2 | Windows11Pro26300 | 3.36 | 1.31 | yes | NOT_AUTHORIZED_LOAD / read-only |
+| PC1 | Windows11Home26200 | 3.38 | 4.45 | yes | BLOCKED / separate Home matrix |
+| LS7 | Windows11Home26200 | 3.42 | 3.89 | yes | BLOCKED / separate Home matrix |
+
+Numbers are point-in-time observations, not a stress test or capacity guarantee.
+An elevated management observer does not qualify non-administrative app runtime.
+It also does not prove a future contained child would retain those privileges;
+that child admission and token must be independently verified before execution.
+Existing candidate parents were present; their ACLs were read, not changed.
+Package digest, protected test namespace, nonprivileged child identity,
+resource containment/ownership cleanup and production-conflict gates have NOT
+passed. Read-only observation complete is not Stage1B admission PASS.
+
+PC2: Reolink was observed running with28245909504 private bytes (26.31GiB),
+working set1229189120 bytes, while free virtual memory was about1.31GiB.
+No restart/stop/settings/pagefile action was performed. Private bytes and working
+set are different metrics; this does not establish a leak or network incident
+cause. Keep Unified load tests blocked and treat maintenance separately.
+
+PC1/LS7: independent14-item Home qualification matrices are included. Edition
+observation and existing pinned SSH do not qualify LAN, services, mTLS, IPC,
+worker engines, Scheduler/Storage, RBAC, logoff/restart or Pro independence.
+All such criteria remain NOT_QUALIFIED; no Pro PASS is transferred.
+
+Required gates before future PC4 smoke:
+1. Pin independently reviewed sources/trees, executable/dependency hashes and
+   package manifest; validate them on the target before executing candidate code.
+2. Verify existing approved nonprivileged runtime identity/key/IPC admission and
+   exact private namespace ACL. Do not provision a new identity or weaken policy
+   merely to bypass a failed gate.
+3. Review bounded CPU/commit/process/time limits and owned-family cleanup on the
+   actual node. Resource observations alone are not containment evidence.
+4. Verify no production conflict, own ephemeral loopback port/state directory,
+   rollback/retained-evidence plan and package-plan-only checks.
+5. Only if all pass, separately qualify the synthetic existing Strattester to
+   MetaAnalyse target and disposable Terminan; preserve original RED/exit/result/
+   DOM/ownership/cleanup/before-after evidence independently for PC4.
+6. Re-evaluate every gate independently on PC3 afterward. Never transfer PC4 or
+   LS5 PASS or automatically advance to multi-node commissioning.
+
+Current report:
+PR78_CI: exact-source hosted results tracked separately; no full matrix PASS.
+LAN_MUX_INVENTORY_ROOT_CAUSE: original hardcoded50 rejects actual68; exactdd4
+already had52, plus16 new pure IDs atb48. Repair must preserve historical50,
+the two existing regressions and all16 new diagnostics. Original hosted RED retained.
+F38: source correction ACK; hosted/runtime qualification pending.
+LS5_BASELINE: retained original1d923f6 scoped synthetic PASS, not repeated.
+PC4_PREFLIGHT: read-only complete / required execution gates BLOCKED.
+PC4_SMOKE: NOT_RUN.
+PC3_PREFLIGHT: read-only complete / required execution gates BLOCKED.
+PC3_SMOKE: NOT_RUN.
+PC2_READINESS: insufficient conservative resource margin, read-only maintenance review.
+PC1_HOME: edition confirmed; capability matrix NOT_QUALIFIED.
+LS7_HOME: edition confirmed; independent capability matrix NOT_QUALIFIED.
+NATIVE_AUTHORITY: strictD4/logical mutationsDISABLED; no positive admission.
+SCHEDULER: positive native job NOT_QUALIFIED.
+STORAGE: committed publication receipt NOT_AVAILABLE.
+TERMINAN: authenticated current scientific READ NOT_QUALIFIED.
+A8_REVIEW: prior PR78sourceACK only; this readiness publication requires review.
+NEXT_STAGE: repair hosted inventory; close PC4package/identity/containment gates.
+GO_NO_GO: IN_PROGRESS / NO-GO.
+
+ADMINIT excluded. Production deployment, real trading, provider sends, multi-node
+commissioning and Tailscale removal remain blocked. No router/network/security
+reset is an allowed recovery action.
+
+A2/A5 independently inspected existing source launch boundaries: no qualified
+Stage1B restricted-token research launch path from an elevated SSH parent was
+found at the inspected sources. Existing WindowsSmokeJob requires an already
+nonadmin parent; suspended worker prepare is not token downgrading. A private
+PostgreSQL provisioning restricted-process helper has a different permit and
+must not be repurposed as a research launcher. No such bypass was attempted.
